<title>USA: Darling International Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Darling International Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		    $0.24   profit	 $0.38</p>
<p> Net loss		    1,253   profit	 2,061</p>
<p> Revs			127,249		   95,467</p>
<p>			9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $1.14   profit	 $2.18</p>
<p> Net profit		  6,291   profit	11,543</p>
<p> Revs			351,242		  307,715</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 net includes provision for loss contingency related to environmental claims at Blue Earth, Minn., plant of $5.9 million in Q3 and $6.1 million for nine months.</p>
<p>1996 oper shr excluding provision is profit $0.66 in Q3 and profit $2.02 for nine months.</p>
<p>Full company name is Darling International Inc.</p>
